1. OWNERSHIP

This repository and all of its contents are the exclusive property of Maykol
Rey (the "Owner"), except for the third-party components listed in NOTICE.md.
This includes, without limitation:

  a) the software and firmware (source code, binaries and scripts);
  b) the hardware designs: schematics, printed circuit boards (PCBs), bills
     of materials and manufacturing files;
  c) the mechanical designs and 3D models;
  d) the documentation, texts, diagrams, photographs and images;
  e) the name "FireFly", its logo and other distinctive signs.

Nothing in this license transfers ownership of any of the above.

2. LIMITED EVALUATION PERMISSION

The Owner grants anyone accessing this repository a personal, free,
non-exclusive, non-transferable and revocable permission to:

  a) view and download the contents; and
  b) build, install and run the software and firmware on their own equipment
     and test environments,

solely to evaluate or technically validate the project, and for no commercial
purpose.

3. RESTRICTIONS

Unless the Owner has given prior written authorization, you may not:

  a) use the contents, in whole or in part, for commercial purposes or in
     production installations;
  b) copy, publish, redistribute, sell, rent or sublicense the contents,
     whether modified or unmodified;
  c) create derivative works, except for modifications strictly necessary for
     the evaluation, which may not be distributed;
  d) manufacture, have manufactured or sell boards, devices or enclosures
     based on the hardware or mechanical designs;
  e) use the contents to develop a competing product or service;
  f) use the name "FireFly" or its logo, or present the work as your own;
  g) remove or alter authorship notices, copyright notices or this license.

4. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

Third-party components keep their own licenses, listed in NOTICE.md. This
license does not limit the rights those licenses grant over such components.

5. TERM AND TERMINATION

The permission in section 2 ends:

  a) automatically if any condition of this license is breached;
  b) when the Owner gives notice; or
  c) when the Owner withdraws public access to the repository.

When the permission ends, all copies of the contents must be deleted.
Sections 1, 3, 6 and 7 survive termination.

6. NO WARRANTY AND LIMITATION OF LIABILITY

The contents are provided "AS IS", without warranties of any kind, express or
implied, including merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose and
non-infringement. The project is under development and holds no electrical
safety, electromagnetic compatibility or emergency lighting certifications.
It must not be used as the sole means of verifying emergency installations.

In no event shall the Owner be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental or
consequential damages arising from the use of, or inability to use, the
